"2"><topPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><leftPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><bottomPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><rightPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/></box><textElement textAlignment="Left" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="8"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["(xi)"]]></textFieldExpression></textField><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement stretchType="ContainerHeight" x="178" y="0" width="178" height="312" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000457"/><box leftPadding="3" rightPadding="3" topPadding="2" bottomPadding="2"><topPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><leftPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><bottomPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><rightPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/></box><textElement textAlignment="Center" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="8" isBold="true"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["<b>General Conditions</b>"]]></textFieldExpression></textField><frame><reportElement stretchType="ContainerHeight" x="356" y="0" width="179" height="486" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000464"/><box><topPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><leftPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><bottomPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><rightPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/></box><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement positionType="Float" x="22" y="0" width="157" height="112" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000458"/><textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["<b>I.</b>&nbsp; The Borrower agrees and authorises the Lender to debit to and recover from any account maintained by on or behalf of the Borrower with the Lender, now or in future, towards recovery of any and all costs, charges and expenses stipulated herein or in connection with or incidental to the Loan. "]]></textFieldExpression></textField><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement positionType="Float" x="22" y="114" width="157" height="40" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000459"/><textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["<b>II.</b>&nbsp; The Borrower shall upon demand pay to or reimburse the Lender in full:    "]]></textFieldExpression></textField><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement positionType="Float" x="22" y="154" width="157" height="40" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000460"/><textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA[" <b>a.</b> The legal costs of the preparation of financing/security document, creation of security etc.;"]]></textFieldExpression></textField><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement positionType="Float" x="22" y="194" width="157" height="112" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000461"/><textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA[" <b>b.</b> All costs, expenses and other charges at actuals including but not limited to all costs, expenses and fees relating to the periodic valuation, title search, site visit, inspection, insurance and protection/preservation in any other manner of the security tendered to the Lender; and"]]></textFieldExpression></textField><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement positionType="Float" x="22" y="306" width="157" height="88" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000462"/><textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA[" <b>c.</b> All costs (including legal fees) incurred by the Lender in preserving perfecting or enforcing any of its rights under or in respect of this letter/financing documents, or any present or future security and other documents."]]></textFieldExpression></textField><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement positionType="Float" x="22" y="396" width="157" height="88" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000463"/><textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["<b>III.</b>&nbsp; The Borrower understands, acknowledges and agrees that the undrawn portion of the Loan may be cancelled and repudiated in part or in entirety by the Lender, at any time without notice and without giving any reason. "]]></textFieldExpression></textField></frame></frame><break><reportElement positionType="Float" x="0" y="312" width="535" height="1" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000465"/></break><frame><reportElement positionType="Float" x="0" y="313" width="535" height="411" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000466"/><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement stretchType="ContainerHeight" x="0" y="0" width="178" height="411" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000467"/><box leftPadding="3" rightPadding="3" topPadding="2" bottomPadding="2"><topPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><leftPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><bottomPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><rightPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/></box><textElement textAlignment="Left" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="8"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["(xi)"]]></textFieldExpression></textField><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement stretchType="ContainerHeight" x="178" y="0" width="178" height="411" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000468"/><box leftPadding="3" rightPadding="3" topPadding="2" bottomPadding="2"><topPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><leftPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><bottomPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><rightPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/></box><textElement textAlignment="Center" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="8" isBold="true"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["<b>General Conditions</b>"]]></textFieldExpression></textField><frame><reportElement stretchType="ContainerHeight" x="356" y="0" width="179" height="600" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000473"/><box><topPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><leftPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><bottomPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><rightPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/></box><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement positionType="Float" x="22" y="0" width="157" height="40" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000469"/><textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["<b>IV.</b>&nbsp; All costs, charges, interest rates are exclusive of applicable taxes. "]]></textFieldExpression></textField><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement positionType="Float" x="22" y="42" width="157" height="100" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000470"/><textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["<b>V.</b>&nbsp; <b>Release of original movable / immovable property documents:</b> Borrower(s) can collect the original movable/ immovable property documents from the branch where the loan account was serviced, within 30 (thirty) days after full repayment/ settlement of the loan. "]]></textFieldExpression></textField><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement positionType="Float" x="22" y="144" width="157" height="292" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000471"/><textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["<b>VI.</b>&nbsp; The Borrower(s) authorize and give consent to the Lender to disclose without notice to the Borrower(s), information furnished by the Borrower(s) in Application/ related documents executed/ or to be executed in relation to the Loan availed from the Lender, to Lender's other branches, subsidiaries, affiliates, group companies and sister concerns, credit bureaus, rating agencies, service providers, banks/ financial institutions, Government/ Regulatory authorities or third parties for KYC information verification, credit risk analysis, or for other related purposes that the Lender may deem fit. The Borrower(s) waive the privilege of privacy and privacy of contract. The Borrower(s) hereby authorize the Lender to conduct a credit bureau check based on details furnished with respect to the Application. "]]></textFieldExpression></textField><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement positionType="Float" x="22" y="438" width="157" height="160" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000472"/><textElement textAlignment="Justified" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["<b>VII.</b>&nbsp; Change in Applicable Rate of Interest and other pricing parameters may be communicated by the Lender through any of the following modes – through email id as updated in Lender’s records, letter sent to Borrower’s address as updated in Lender’s records, over website of the Lender, through account statements, through Short Message Service (SMS) or through its branches or such other medium as the Lender may consider appropriate. "]]></textFieldExpression></textField></frame></frame><break><reportElement positionType="Float" x="0" y="724" width="535" height="1" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000474"/></break></band><band height="722" splitType="Stretch"><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement positionType="Float" x="0" y="0" width="535" height="16" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000475"/><textElement textAlignment="Center" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="9"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA[" <b>EXHIBIT I</b>"]]></textFieldExpression></textField><frame><reportElement positionType="Float" x="0" y="16" width="535" height="17" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000476"/><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement stretchType="ContainerHeight" x="0" y="0" width="178" height="17" uuid="abcd0000-0000-0000-0000-000000000477"/><box leftPadding="3" rightPadding="3" topPadding="2" bottomPadding="2"><topPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><leftPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><bottomPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/><rightPen lineWidth="0.75" lineColor="#000000"/></box><textElement textAlignment="Center" verticalAlignment="Top" markup="html"><font fontName="SansSerif" size="8" isBold="true"/></textElement><textFieldExpression><![CDATA["Sr. No."]]></textFieldExpression></textField><textField isStretchWithOverflow="true" isBlankWhenNull="true" textAdjust="StretchHeight"><reportElement stretchType="ContainerH